OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over pupil suspensions at
OL,4,Aspecial unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of pupils at a special needs
OL,7,Funit in Berkshire say every single
OL,8,Fchild has been suspended since the
OL,9,Fstart of the last month's new school
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FResource Base at Kennet Valley Primary
OL,13,FSchool opened the dedicated unit in
OL,14,F2024 but since then had to close,
OL,15,Ftemporarily, because of staffing
OL,16,Fissues.
OL,18,FSaffy, who's son Kai was sent home,
OL,19,Fclaimed it followed the introduction of
OL,20,Fa new behaviour code. "It's been
OL,21,Fhorrific," she said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
