OL,3,GNEWSAConcern over pupil suspensions at
OL,4,Aspecial unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Berkshire Council pushed back
OL,7,Fagainst the parents' claims. It said
OL,8,Fonly 40% of pupils had been suspended,
OL,9,Faccording to the government's
OL,10,Fdefinition, as the school works to
OL,11,F"strengthen standards."
